          "host": [
            "{{host}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "gmail",
            "sync"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Returns 200 (with sync results) when the caller has a connected Gmail account, or 409 GMAIL_NOT_CONNECTED when they do not. The collection's signup-based auth means the running user is fresh and has no connection, so 409 is the typical outcome here."
